    and the power of two it closes on. -/
theorem t7_betti_row_is_the_uuid : (1 + 7 + 21 + 35 + 35 + 21 + 7 + 1 = 128) ∧ (128 = 2 ^ 7) := by decide

/-- THE TWO BOARDS LIVE INSIDE THE SEVENTH DIMENSION: the row's even-index entries sum to 64 and the odd-index
