theorem t7_even_odd_boards_equal : (1 + 21 + 35 + 7 = 64) ∧ (7 + 35 + 21 + 1 = 64) ∧ (64 + 64 = 128) := by decide

/-- THE MIDDLE OF THE ROW SPEAKS THE LEDGER'S TONGUES: the row's third entry is 21 = 3 · 7 — trinity times
